  "html": "<p>The Revenants are not, in fact, one race: rather, it is a name that encompasses all mystical and spiritual beings that visit this plane.  They typically do not walk, but appear to float.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 3 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>K</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Knight\" title=\"Category:Knight\">Knight</a></li></ul><h3>O</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Oracle\" title=\"Category:Oracle\">Oracle</a></li></ul><h3>P</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Phantom\" title=\"Category:Phantom\">Phantom</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Revenants\"</h2>\n<p>There are 24 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>1</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/1/2_Blade\" title=\"1/2 Blade\">1/2 Blade</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Felknight\" title=\"Arctic Felknight\">Arctic Felknight</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Haunt\" title=\"Burning Haunt\">Burning Haunt</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dangerous_Dmitri\" title=\"Dangerous Dmitri\">Dangerous Dmitri</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Felknight\" title=\"Divine Felknight\">Divine Felknight</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Phantom\" title=\"Divine Phantom\">Divine Phantom</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Soothsayer\" title=\"Divine Soothsayer\">Divine Soothsayer</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Felknight\" title=\"Embercore Felknight\">Embercore Felknight</a></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>E cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a hre